So 'rekyboldi'u' could be used to describe the class of all geosesic
domes...but now I have learned that the type of geodome i was referring to
is the specific type made of triangles (and what if I mean the type with
windows, does this then make the word used even more complex?)

Does anyone guess my game here yet (I suspect Bob does and that he has
already got the next move planned out)?  Because this exercise has already
succeeded.

